# InkMarshal desktop has no checked-in build-time secrets or public-site env.
# The public website and its NEXT_PUBLIC_* variables live in ../AiNovelSite.
# release:mac requires non-secret process env:
#   APPLE_SIGNING_IDENTITY
#   APPLE_TEAM_ID
#   APPLE_NOTARY_KEYCHAIN_PROFILE
# Store notary credentials once with:
#   xcrun notarytool store-credentials
# Do not put Apple ID or app-specific passwords in this repository.
